*.npy
*.npz
*.bin

# Never track recording/input trees, including generated enhancement output.
**/audio/**
**/recordings/**
**/recording/**
**/media_inputs/**
**/enhanced_audio/**
**/denoised_audio/**
**/normalized_audio/**
*.tar
*.tar.gz
